  "title": "UN Agency Faces Aid Cut as Gaza Faces Food Crisis",
  "summary": "The UN agency in Palestine will cut aid to Gaza, reducing support from around 1.6 million to 1.1 million, and faces food insecurity as more than 200,000 people face famine.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The number of people helped by the UN agency in the Palestinian territory will drop by about a third - from 1.6 million to 1.1 million",
